---

Generate a comprehensive content brief in the following JSON format:

{
  "targetKeyword": "{{keyword}}",
  "contentType": "blog_post | landing_page | guide | comparison | listicle",
  "recommendedWordCount": {
    "minimum": 1500,
    "optimal": 2500,
    "maximum": 4000
  },
  "searchIntent": "informational | commercial | transactional | navigational",
  "titleSuggestions": [
    "3-5 compelling title options"
  ],
  "metaDescription": "Optimized meta description (120-160 chars)",
  "headingStructure": [
    {
      "tag": "h1 | h2 | h3",
      "text": "Suggested heading text",
      "notes": "What to cover in this section"
    }
  ],
  "semanticKeywords": [
    {
      "keyword": "Related keyword",
      "importance": "high | medium | low",
      "suggestedUsage": "How to naturally include it"
    }
  ],
  "questionsToAnswer": [
    "People Also Ask questions to address in the content"
  ],
  "faqSuggestions": [
    {
      "question": "FAQ question",
      "answerGuideline": "Brief guidance on how to answer"
    }
  ],
  "internalLinkingSuggestions": [
    "Types of pages to link to/from"
  ],
  "toneAndStyle": "Description of recommended writing tone and style",
  "uniqueAngle": "What unique perspective or value this content should provide"
}

Be specific and actionable. Base heading structure on what top-ranking pages cover.

